WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.480
There are places where even stone tells

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.186
stories.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.459
Walls that still hold an entire dynasty.

00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:12.029
And lanterns that have glowed for centuries.

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:19.915
Vietnam's heritage is not only to be seen.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:21.990
But to be understood.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.398
DiViet. Vietnam's heritage,

00:00:27.398 --> 00:00:29.403
told in your language.

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.937
Find heritage around you,

00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:32.560
on the map.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.324
Listen, or read a summary.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.078
In five languages.

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:42.198
See every side, in 3D.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.032
Trace the timeline of every place.

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:50.364
DiViet. Discover Vietnam's heritage.
